# mainstage.trk -- the notes of mainstage-trk.patch: Dm | Bb | F | C at
# 128 BPM, one row per sixteenth (the patch clocks it from a 512 BPM clock).
# The arrangement levels live in mainstage-form.trk, one row per four bars.

track kick  note            # 1: four on the floor
track clap  note            # 2: beats 2 and 4
track chop  note            # 3: the trance-gate rhythm that chops the pad
track hook  note            # 4: supersaw hook (its level lane gates it)
track harm  note cva cvb    # 5: chord root, third, fifth (absolute v/oct)
track fx    note            # 6: crash + sub impact on a drop downbeat

# One chord per bar. Every voice -- bass, pad, arp -- reads these three.
pattern chords 64 harm
#    root third fifth
00 | D3   F4    A3
16 | Bb2  D4    F3
32 | F3   A4    C4
48 | C3   E4    G3

# The pad's sixteenth gate: 1011 0101 1010 1101, one bar, looped.
pattern chop 16 chop
00 | x
01 | off
02 | x
03 | x
04 | off
05 | x
06 | off
07 | x
08 | x
09 | off
10 | x
11 | off
12 | x
13 | x
14 | off
15 | x

# Two-bar D-minor-pentatonic hook in straight quarters: A C D C | A G A--.
pattern hook 32 hook
00 | A4
02 | off
04 | C5
06 | off
08 | D5
10 | off
12 | C5
14 | off
16 | A4
18 | off
20 | G4
22 | off
24 | A4
26 | off

# Kick on every quarter (gate an eighth long), clap on 2 and 4.
pattern beat 16 kick clap
#    kick  clap
00 | x
02 | off
04 | x   | x
06 | off | off
08 | x
10 | off
12 | x   | x
14 | off | off

# A drop downbeat: one crash + impact. Sixty-four rows so it does not loop.
pattern hit 64 fx
00 | x
01 | off

# 32 four-bar blocks; levels per block are in mainstage-form.trk.
order chords+chop+hook*6             # 0-5   intro, arp in, grow: no drums
order chords+chop+hook+beat          # 6     build: kick in
order chords+chop+hook               # 7     the lift: kick out
order chords+chop+hook+beat+hit      # 8     DROP 1
order chords+chop+hook+beat*3        # 9-11
order chords+chop+hook*5             # 12-16 breathe, break, build 2
order chords+chop+hook+beat+hit      # 17    DROP 2
order chords+chop+hook+beat*7        # 18-24 the peak, then the groove
order chords+chop+hook*7             # 25-31 peel, fade, silence
